        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Highlights:\r\n\r\nLarge private site with mature gardens\r\nSolar panels fitted \r\nProximity to Knock Airport\r\nSeparate large car garage with automatic roller door\r\nWorkshop\r\nBroad band / Starlink accessibility\r\nCCTV\r\nConstructed c.1998\r\n205.95 Msq\r\n\r\n\r\nLWK northwest is delighted to bring to the market this unique 5-bedroom family home.  Accommodation comprises on the main floor of three double bedrooms with two ensuites, the main bathroom, a large fitted family kitchen with a breakfast island and dining area and the sitting room located to the front of the property.  The second floor comprises of two bedrooms with additional rooms for a potential office space or gym.\r\n \r\nThis property feels never ending with private gardens, a workshop, separate garage and a large, covered area for fuel storage.  The gardens have been lovingly maintained with fruit trees scattered throughout the grounds; for anyone with an interest in gardening there is also a green house on site.\r\n\r\nThis property feels like country living but within a three minute drive to Ballaghaderreen town, which is a town submerged in History with beautiful places of interest interspersed throughout the area.  A new library has just been opened this year and with schools in proximity this property is perfect for family living.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
